e MV3 extension (WXT, TypeScript) snapshots the DOM including open shadow roots, masks PII in-page, runs axe-core and Core Web Vitals, and executes actions. FastAPI and LangGraph decide. No headless Chromium on servers, so hosting stays near zero and logged-in pages work without anyone sharing a password. (02) One HTTP call per agent step. (03) Prompts are never a safety boundary. (04) Fail soft, never fake. (05) The scanner can't be turned into an SSRF. (06) Grounded, measured, regression-tested. (Next project) Agentic planner↗ Let's talk↗ [email] Write a message Résumé ElsewhereGitHub LinkedIn X Hashnode How to reach meFastest way to reach me is email. LinkedIn works too — I check it daily. Hiring for backend, platform or AI engineering? I reply within a day. LocalKolkata, India · 15:25 Open to backend, AI and platform engineering internships and full-time roles — remote or on-site. © 2026 Rohit Maity Theme 02 / 05

